/secaucus/the-harper-at-harmon-meadow-apartments", "total_units_count": 469, "contact_logic": "default", "contact_volume_threshold": 53, "contact_volume_multiplier": null, "year_built": null, "year_remodeled": null, "source_name": "real_page_mits4", "source_display_name": null, "source_listing_url": null, "copyright_disclaimer": null, "listing_agent_name": null, "brokerage_name": null, "upsells": [], "has_cross_sell": true, "covid_disclaimer": false, "ai_nurture_percent": null, "pmc_display_name": null, "listed_status": null, "mls_number": null, "occupancy_types": [], "display_occupancy_types": [], "long_highlight": "At The Harper at Harmon Meadow Apartments, discover vibrant living with spacious, modern units that feature high-quality finishes and appliances. Located in Secaucus, NJ, this property offers easy access to shopping, dining, and transportation, providing straightforward commutes to New York City. The community boasts an array of amenities including a pristine swimming pool, state-of-the-art fitness facilities, and elegant social spaces, perfect for active lifestyles. Renters appreciate the friendly, helpful staff, adding to the allure of this residence. Dogs and cats are welcome, ensuring that you can enjoy these wonderful amenities with your furry friends by your side.", "short_highlight": "The Harper at Harmon Meadow Apartments in Secaucus, NJ, offers vibrant living with modern amenities and prime access to transportation and dining hotspots. This property is highly favored and frequently toured by visitors, reflecting its appeal. Residents love the clean, well-maintained community and enjoy the convenience of shopping, dining, and transportation nearby.", "highlight_title": "Prime Access and Vibrant Living Await", "highlight_tag": "Lifestyle Hub", "logo_public_id": null, "office_name": null, "office_phone": null, "agent_name": null, "broker_license_number": null, "deposit_fee_text": "$$1,000 \u2013 1x month", "application_fee_text": "$$175 per applic